    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "hj4j8",
      "x": 3193,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 281,
      "height": 520,
      "content": "- on scrolling, the top bar vanishes\n\n- clicking on the avatar switcher will open up the settings page.\n\n- the workspace switcher on the right (works like the swipeable account switcher of gmail) will allow you to switch between workspaces (media and fitness)\n\n- clicking on it it will open up a bottom sheet which have 4 different targets: media, fitness (like before), Collections and \"More Saved Views\".\n\n- while the switcher bottom sheet is open the bottom bar is hidden: the sheet takes over the bottom of the screen and only the home indicator stays on top of it. dismissing the sheet brings the bottom bar back."
    },
